  {
   "t": "h2",
   "text": "ADD VOLUME TO YOUR SKIN"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "When it comes to fillers, our skilled aestheticians know how to treat your skin and makes it look naturally full. As you age, your skin tends to lose natural collagen, which your skin relies on to appear youthful and smooth. With our dermal filler treatments in Austin, you\u2019ll be able to erase lines and wrinkles, and lift sunken skin to give your skin the youthful appearance it deserves."
  },
  {
   "t": "h2",
   "text": "HOW DO FILLERS WORK?"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "When it comes to dermal fillers, our specialists at the Victory MedSpa will inject a substance, typically hyaluronic acid, into your skin that fills in deep lines and creases and adds volume to sunken or thin areas."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Fillers are great for the lines around your mouth, plumping thin lips, and for adding volume to your cheeks. Different fillers will target different areas and results, so have a look below to see which filler would work best for you!"
  },
  {
   "t": "h2",
   "text": "FILLERS WE OFFER & CUSTOMIZE FOR YOUR SKIN"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "The Aestheticians at the Victory MedSpa will recommend the filler that will work best for your skin. Contact us to set up your filler consultation today!"
  },
